  "_learning_tip_0": "{0} players are relaxing and sorting fish right now.",
  "_learning_tip_1": "There is something incredibly calming about watching fish swim into their tanks.",
  "_learning_tip_2": "Playing for just 30 minutes a day can really help you relieve stress.",
  "_learning_tip_3": "There is something wonderfully satisfying about clearing colorful bubble clusters.",
  "_learning_tip_4": "Pop the bubbles, clear your mind, and let the stress melt away with every match.",
  "_learning_tip_5": "Recharge your energy with a few minutes of relaxing ocean puzzle fun.",
  "_learning_tip_6": "A few minutes of play can make the rest of your day feel easier.",
  "_learning_tip_7": "Let every popping bubble carry away a little bit of the stress from your day.",
  "_learning_tip_8": "You're definitely not the only one enjoying a satisfying fish puzzle today.",
